Placeholder. Replace this file with the real ASCII-armored public key
exported from the GPG keypair you generate for signing the APT repo
metadata. The companion private key goes into the APT_SIGNING_KEY
GitHub Actions secret as a base64-encoded blob (see PACKAGING.md →
"Linux APT repository (one-time setup)").

Until this placeholder is replaced, the release-apt.yml workflow
short-circuits on the missing APT_SIGNING_KEY secret and emits a
::notice:: pointing here. Releases otherwise continue normally;
only the APT-repo publish step is gated on this key.

